            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sumeetha S\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat place to dine in\nOct 2025 • Family\nWe had sambar, dosa, medhu vadai, pongal, puri. All were of great taste. When we traveled, we took tamarind rice to eat on the way and that was again very delicious. Unlike other south indian restaurants outside India, I found this restaurant to be authentic and genuine. Please go for it if u r craving for south indian varieties. 😃\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 12, 2026",
